Frost DK PvP Burst rotation.

TALENTS ASSUMED: Killing Machine, Rime, Deathchill, Chilblains, Hungering Cold, Improved Icebound Fortitude, Lichborne. 2H build (Nerves of Cold Steel optional for 1H).

STRATEGY: burst opener chain: Trinkets + Empower Rune Weapon + Unbreakable Armor + Deathchill -&gt; Obliterate (KM+DC crit) -&gt; Frost Strike RP dump -&gt; free Howling Blast on Rime proc. Chains of Ice on out-of-melee targets (Chilblains root chance).

FOCUS SETUP: set /focus on the enemy healer or main caster. Strangulate silences focus interruptibles (30yd); Mind Freeze covers current target melee interrupts; Death Grip pulls focus out of range.

DEFENSIVE AUTO:
- IBF: HP &lt; 55% or on stun debuff table;
- AMS: caster target casting, or HP &lt; 70% vs caster class;
- Lichborne: HP &lt; 45% or feared -&gt; Death Coil self-heal fires while aura up;
- Death Pact: HP &lt; 17% with ghoul;
- Hungering Cold: emergency AoE freeze at HP &lt; 55%.

MANUAL:
- Left Ctrl pauses rotation;
- pre-pull Raise Dead for Death Pact insurance.

Blood DK PvP Burst rotation.

TALENTS ASSUMED: Butchery, Subversion, Bladed Armor, Dark Conviction, Blood-Caked Blade, Sudden Doom, Vampiric Blood, Mark of Blood, Improved Rune Tap, Hysteria, Dancing Rune Weapon. Off-tree: Lichborne, Anti-Magic Shell (baseline).

STRATEGY: burst chain: Trinkets + Hysteria (self) + Empower Rune Weapon + Dancing Rune Weapon -&gt; Heart Strike x2 + Death Strike + Rune Strike -&gt; Death Coil RP dumps (Sudden Doom = free). DRW mirrors your strikes for 12s = double damage window.

FOCUS SETUP: /focus enemy healer/caster. Strangulate silences focus casts; Mind Freeze on target; Death Grip pulls focus.

DEFENSIVE AUTO:
- IBF: HP &lt; 55% or on stun;
- AMS: caster pressure;
- Vampiric Blood: HP &lt; 65% (+15% max HP);
- Rune Tap: HP &lt; 75% (30s CD heal);
- Mark of Blood: on melee attacker while HP &lt; 80%;
- Lichborne: HP &lt; 45% -&gt; Death Coil self-heal;
- Death Pact: HP &lt; 17%.

MANUAL:
- Left Ctrl pauses rotation;
- pre-pull Raise Dead for Death Pact insurance;
- Hysteria costs 1% HP/s -- rotation gates it on HP &gt; 70%.
